"ESPN"},{"headline":"Ohio State's Jeremiah Smith sets Big Ten receiving record","description":"Ohio State wide receiver Jeremiah Smith broke yet another record, eclipsing the Big Ten mark for career receiving yards during the first half vs. Northwestern.","published":"2026-11-14T18:42:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481134/ohio-state-jeremiah-smith-sets-big-ten-receiving-record","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Tracking Ohio State WR Jeremiah Smith's record-setting 2026 season","description":"Ohio State's superstar receiver has made breaking records a weekly occurrence this fall.","published":"2026-11-14T18:05:18.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50142903/jeremiah-smith-ohio-state-record-tracker","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Alabama makes last-second call to start QB Keelon Russell","description":"No. 3 Alabama made a last-second decision to start Keelon Russell against Vanderbilt after the quarterback looked better than anticipated in pregame warmups.","published":"2026-11-14T18:56:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50480988/alabama-makes-last-second-call-start-qb-keelon-russell","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Maryland QB Malik Washington doesn't start vs. Wisconsin","description":"Maryland quarterback Malik Washington did not start against Wisconsin as he continues to deal with a lower-body injury.","published":"2026-11-14T17:50:19.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50480722/source-maryland-qb-malik-washington-start-vs-wisconsin","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Colorado upsets No. 14 Houston for first AP top-15 win since 2007","description":"Colorado posted its first victory over an AP top-15 team since 2007 in beating No. 14 Houston 42-32 and slightly cooled down the hot seat for coach Deion Sanders.","published":"2026-11-14T14:22:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50479172/colorado-upsets-no-14-houston-1st-ap-top-15-win-2007","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Ole Miss-Oklahoma bumped to Sunday despite Sooners AD's 'strong objection'","description":"Oklahoma AD Roger Denny was critical of the SEC's decision to move the Sooners' home game against Ole Miss to Sunday following Friday's nationwide ground stop.","published":"2026-11-14T17:36:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50478281/ole-miss-oklahoma-bumped-sunday-sooners-ad-rips-decision","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"UCLA QB Ty Dieffenbach says first-half shoulder injury vs. Illinois not serious","description":"UCLA starting quarterback Ty Dieffenbach exited because of a shoulder injury late in the second quarter but returned to lead the Bruins past Illinois 22-14.","published":"2026-11-14T17:06:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50477249/ucla-qb-ty-dieffenbach-leaves-game-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest claims 'Bachelor U' status after Sam Hartman news","description":"Wake Forest football is the only program, the school says, to have had three former players feature in \"The Bachelor\" franchise.","published":"2026-11-13T23:57:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50475193/sam-hartman-bachelor-wake-forest","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"FAA ground stop throws sports world into travel chaos ahead of weekend games","description":"Travel plans for teams in multiple sports were disrupted by the FAA's nationwide ground stop of all flights because of communications problems.","published":"2026-11-14T15:50:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50475169/faa-ground-stop-disrupting-travel-college-football-teams","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5146422/xavier-gilliam","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam"},"pick":{"pick":18,"round":1,"team":"CLE","via":"LAR","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Xavier Gilliam","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:38:11Z","intro":"Xavier Harold Gilliam is an American football defensive tackle for the Tennessee Volunteers. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Gilliam attended Wilde Lake High School in Columbia, Maryland and Quince Orchard High School in Gaithersburg, Maryland. He committed to play college football for the Penn State Nittany Lions over offers from Boston College, Maryland, Ole Miss, Texas A&M, West Virginia, and Virginia Tech."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman at Penn State in 2024, Gilliam was redshirted. During the 2025 season, he appeared in 13 games with two starts, totaling 15 tackles with two for loss, a forced fumble, and a blocked field goal. After the conclusion of the season, Gilliam entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nGilliam transferred to play for the Tennessee Volunteers. In the 2026 season opener, he posted six tackles with five for loss, and three sacks in a win over Furman."}]}}